codex
The first pass shows two important things: the OptInMonster route really is public at registration time, but the add-form AJAX nonce is only localized when the admin notice is rendered. I’m checking the exact nonce exposure sites now, because that determines whether those “public-but-nonce-gated” paths are materially reachable or just theoretically reachable.
